error BYN7003: `become` needs `becomes .paid` on `pay`

  9 │         become .paid(amount)
    │         ^^^^^^
    │
  help: add `becomes .paid` to the signature of `pay`
    │ 8 │     void pay(move this is .draft, i64 amount) becomes .paid {
    │   │                                              ++++++++++++++

error BYN7003: `become .paid` is not declared; `ship` becomes `.shipped`

